 `vsr-rs` is based on the paper [Viewstamped Replication Revisited](https://dspace.mit.edu/entities/publication/80846d94-fcd3-40e6-87fb-8d91fe99a5d1) by Liskov and Cowling, which updates the original [Viewstamped Replication: A New Primary Copy Method to Support Highly-Available Distributed Systems](https://www.cs.princeton.edu/courses/archive/fall11/cos518/papers/viewstamped.pdf) by Oki and Liskov.\n However, the algorithm in the paper has the following known bugs:\n \n * The recovery algorithm described in Section 4.3 can result in the system being in an inconsistent state as reported by Michael et al in Appendix B1 of [Recovering Shared Objects Without Stable Storage](https://drkp.net/papers/recovery-tr17.pdf)"}]}